:: R5_Closing [r5 system]
<<set $objective = "">>

Tomorrow the alarm will go off and I'll shower and shave and stand in front of the closet, and the matching set will be waiting in the bottom of my briefcase, folded together the way Lena folds hers.

Same Daniel. That's what she called it. That's what I keep calling it too, in the small hours, when the label is the only thing holding the shape together.

